      "cooked": "<p>Hello team,</p>\n<p>I believe I found an issue in ERPNext Material request doctype. The scenario is -</p>\n<p>I created a material request with purpose as “Customer Provided”. Once this document is saved and submitted; the status is changed to “Pending”.</p>\n<p>Once the material is received, I created the Material Receipt Document. I can see the stock ledger updated in the system properly.</p>\n<p>However, when I again check the Material request doctype, I can see “Received” in green on that document; but the status is changed to “Draft” instead of Pending.</p>\n<p>Here is the screenshot of the Same. Has someone else encountered this issue? Am I missing something?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/c/6/c643e1db2921411e98cb5edfa5982c8a895ba6d6.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/c643e1db2921411e98cb5edfa5982c8a895ba6d6\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c643e1db2921411e98cb5edfa5982c8a895ba6d6_2_690x239.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"shVYwvHdPvqtFr21pYX7dAtO35k\" width=\"690\" height=\"239\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c643e1db2921411e98cb5edfa5982c8a895ba6d6_2_690x239.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c643e1db2921411e98cb5edfa5982c8a895ba6d6_2_1035x358.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/c/6/c643e1db2921411e98cb5edfa5982c8a895ba6d6_2_1380x478.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"1B1B1B\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1563×543 41.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>Thanks<br>\n~Aniruddha</p>",
